<title>SOUTH AFRICA: HARVEYS SAYS IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</title>
<headline>HARVEYS SAYS IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harveys Curnow Ltd said on Monday it was in negotiations which if successfully concluded could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their sharedealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
